    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a [new binding gate for Meridian deployments](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1), mandating a signed release manifest for all staging and production releases. This directive is framed as a [direct response to past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), specifically citing the unauthorized arrival of unsigned artifacts in staging. The policy is presented with [formal, decision-oriented finality](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3), explicitly defining the [scope of the mandate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) and [asserting personal ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) over the enforcement mechanism. The voice profile here is characterized by a short, punchy cadence and a shift between formal, authoritative declarations and plain-spoken justification for the change.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The justification for the gate rests on a specific past failure, contrasting with the abstract, forward-looking nature of the rule itself." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The assertion of personal ownership in the final note shifts the tone from systemic policy to individual accountability." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "Switches between formal, authoritative pronouncements and plain-spoken, reactive explanations." ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "Maintains a short, punchy cadence that prioritizes brevity and immediate clarity." ; narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
